What the Server class is

import { Server } from "socket.io"

This Server class:

Listens for incoming socket connections on top of the HTTP server.

Manages rooms, events, and broadcasting.

Provides methods like:

io.on("connection", callback) — runs whenever a client connects.

io.emit() — sends messages to all connected clients.

io.to(socketId).emit() — sends a message to a specific user.
